@startuml Email Ingestion Flow
!theme plain

title Email Ingestion Flow

actor "Research Analyst" as User
participant "Email Server\n(IMAP/Graph)" as Email
participant "Ingestion\nService" as Ingestion
participant "Parser" as Parser
queue "RabbitMQ" as Queue
participant "Processing\nService" as Processing
participant "OCR\nWorker" as OCR
participant "NER\nWorker" as NER
participant "Classifier" as Classify
participant "Deduplication" as Dedupe
database "Elasticsearch" as ES
database "S3" as S3
participant "Notification\nService" as Notify
participant "Slack" as Slack

== Email Arrival ==

User -> Email : Send email to\nresearch@tenant.archon.io
note right of Email : Email with PDF attachment\narrives in tenant mailbox

== Polling & Ingestion ==

Ingestion -> Email : Poll for new emails\n(scheduled / webhook)
activate Ingestion
Email --> Ingestion : New email(s)

Ingestion -> Parser : Parse email
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : Extract metadata\n(sender, subject, date)
Parser -> Parser : Extract attachments
Parser --> Ingestion : Parsed email + attachments
deactivate Parser

Ingestion -> S3 : Store raw attachment
S3 --> Ingestion : s3_path

Ingestion -> Queue : Enqueue processing job
Queue --> Ingestion : job_id
deactivate Ingestion

note over Queue : Async boundary\nClient doesn't wait

== Document Processing Pipeline ==

Queue -> Processing : Consume job
activate Processing

Processing -> Processing : Create ProcessingJob record\nstatus = "running"

Processing -> OCR : Extract text
activate OCR
OCR -> OCR : Tesseract / Textract
OCR --> Processing : extracted_text
deactivate OCR

Processing -> NER : Extract entities
activate NER
NER -> NER : spaCy + finance models
NER --> Processing : entities (companies, tickers, people)
deactivate NER

Processing -> Classify : Categorize document
activate Classify
Classify -> Classify : ML classifier
Classify --> Processing : category, tags
deactivate Classify

Processing -> Dedupe : Check for duplicates
activate Dedupe
Dedupe -> Dedupe : SHA-256 + SimHash

alt Duplicate detected
    Dedupe --> Processing : duplicate_of: doc_123
    Processing -> Processing : Link to existing document
    Processing -> Processing : Mark job completed\n(deduplicated)
else Unique document
    Dedupe --> Processing : unique
    deactivate Dedupe

    Processing -> ES : Index document
    activate ES
    ES --> Processing : indexed
    deactivate ES

    Processing -> Processing : Mark job completed\n(indexed)
end

deactivate Processing

== Notification ==

Processing -> Notify : Document ready event
activate Notify
Notify -> Slack : Post to #research channel
Slack --> Notify : delivered
Notify --> Processing : notified
deactivate Notify

note right of Slack : "New research from\njsmith@broker.com:\nQ4 Earnings Analysis"

@enduml
